1
00:00:01,376 --> 00:00:03,091
Everything's settled

2
00:00:03,175 --> 00:00:04,504
with Shin Yoo-il's
agency

3
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:06,540
Don't worry

4
00:00:08,251 --> 00:00:09,744
It feels awkward

5
00:00:09,828 --> 00:00:12,638
seeing you talking
so seriously to me

6
00:00:12,763 --> 00:00:13,763
Ah,

7
00:00:14,139 --> 00:00:16,266
and I'm going to America

8
00:00:16,808 --> 00:00:17,392
America?

9
00:00:17,517 --> 00:00:18,517
Yeah

10
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:21,480
When are you leaving?

11
00:00:21,564 --> 00:00:23,106
I'll see you off
to the airport

12
00:00:23,232 --> 00:00:24,650
No, you don't need to

13
00:00:24,775 --> 00:00:26,193
I'm not gonna
stay there forever

14
00:00:27,986 --> 00:00:28,986
What?

15
00:00:29,071 --> 00:00:32,407
Hey, don't look at me as if
I'm never coming back

16
00:00:37,621 --> 00:00:38,664
You're coming back
right?

17
00:00:39,748 --> 00:00:40,748
Of course

18
00:00:41,166 --> 00:00:44,024
When I come back
I'll have become

19
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:46,004
the best director

20
00:00:51,802 --> 00:00:52,802
You're here

21
00:00:54,888 --> 00:00:56,974
Didn't you treat
that wound yet?

22
00:00:57,266 --> 00:00:58,266
Come on in

23
00:01:11,154 --> 00:01:12,154
Hyesung

24
00:01:15,951 --> 00:01:16,994
You know my nickname

25
00:01:19,037 --> 00:01:20,037
is Shindecent

26
00:01:22,791 --> 00:01:24,418
Since I was a trainee

27
00:01:24,835 --> 00:01:27,588
I've been used to people
calling me like that

28
00:01:28,964 --> 00:01:31,425
Groundless rumors
spread everywhere

29
00:01:32,843 --> 00:01:35,053
but I thought
it didn't matter

30
00:01:35,178 --> 00:01:36,827
because I was
reaching to the top

31
00:01:37,431 --> 00:01:38,551
I didn't even
think of myself

32
00:01:39,891 --> 00:01:42,269
as such a good person

33
00:01:44,938 --> 00:01:45,939
But

34
00:01:46,857 --> 00:01:48,483
I'm afraid
you'll get hurt

35
00:01:52,154 --> 00:01:53,405
if you stay next to me
